  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SCAAN - Security Communications and Analysis Network Application</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will allow for an inception phase of SCAAN by International Telecommunications Union (ITU) personnel to enhance their security and ITU&apos;s duty of care. ITU plan to equip their personnel with SCAAN, connecting the staff members with a network of security officers who can assist them in urgent situations.</narrative>
  </description>
